  m_Text: Shed everywhere shed everywhere stretching attack your ankles chase the
    red dot, hairball run catnip eat the grass sniff do i like standing on litter
    cuz i sits when i have spaces, my cat buddies have no litter i live in luxury
    cat life poop on the floor, break a planter, sprint, eat own hair, vomit hair,
    hiss, chirp at birds, eat a squirrel, hide from fireworks, lick toe beans, attack
    christmas tree.
